    "title": "Downtown Gears Up for First-Ever Texarkana Taco Festival - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jeff Easterling ,\n10 hours ago Get ready, Texarkana—because downtown is about to turn into taco central. This weekend it’s all about the Flavors, Fun, and Fierce Competition!. The first-ever Texarkana Taco Festival is happening this Saturday, May 9th at Front Street Plaza, and organizers say it’s shaping up to be one of the most fun—and flavorful—events of the year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
